/Title (MPC5554 Microcontroller - Data Sheet)
/Author ( Freescale Semiconductor, Inc.)
/Subject (The MPC5554 microcontroller \(MCU\) is a member of the MPC5500 family of microcontrollers uilt on the Power Architecture? embedded technology. The MPC5554 has two levels of memory hierarchy. The fastest accesses are to the 32-kilobytes \(KB\) unified cache. The next level in the hierarchy contains the 64-KB on-chip internal SRAM and two-megabytes \(MB\) internal flash memory.)
/Keywords (MPC5554, MPC5500 family, Power Architecture, memory hierarchy, 32-kilobytes \(KB\) unified cache, 64 KB on-chip SRAM, two megabytes \(MB\) internal flash memory)
>>
endobj
